{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40536","headline":"经费拾遗旧隐 · 胡骈","name":"经费拾遗旧隐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"林下茅斋已半倾，九华幽迳少人行。\n不将冠劒爲荣事，只向烟萝寄此生。\n松竹渐荒池上色，琴书徒立世间名。\n白杨风起秋山暮，时复哀猨啼一声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡骈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40536.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40536","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}